<title>TURKEY: Turkish exports fall 1.2 percent in January yr-yr.</title>
<headline>Turkish exports fall 1.2 percent in January yr-yr.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's January exports fell 1.2 percent to $1.7 billion, while imports rose 10.2 percent to $3.3 billion from year ago levels, the State Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>It said January's trade deficit rose 25.6 percent to $1.6 billion.</p>
<p>(MLN DLR) Jan97   Jan96    Dec96   Jan-Dec96</p>
<p>Exports   1,715.0 1,735.4  n.a.    n.a.</p>
<p>Imports   3,319.6 3,013.0  n.a.    n.a.</p>
<p>Deficit   1,604.6 1,277.6  n.a.    n.a.</p>
</text>
